{"text": "IRS Correspondence Summary\nCalloway Tax & Advisory - client file memo\nItem\tDetail\nClient\tGwendolyn P. Farnsworth-Ito\nClient no.\t2019-0338\nSSN\tXXX-XX-3244\nNotice\tCP2000, tax year 2023\nNotice date\tDecember 8, 2025\nAUR control no.\t71003-4418-2\nPrepared by\tRenee Calloway, EA\nMemo date\t1/6/2026\n\nWhat the notice says\nThe IRS matched third-party forms against the 2023 joint return filed by Mrs. Farnsworth-Ito and her late husband, Hiroshi Ito (died July 3, 2024; his SSN ends in 7914). It proposes additional tax of $6,418, a 20% accuracy penalty under IRC § 6662 of $1,284, and interest of $512.33, for a total of $8,214.33.\nTwo items drive the change. First, Form 1099-B from Pinnacle Ridge Brokerage (account 811-40297) reported proceeds of $58,900 with no basis shown, and the return left the sale off entirely. Second, a Form 1099-R from the Pacific Cannery Workers Pension Trust showed a $4,100 distribution to Mr. Ito that was not reported.\nOur assessment\nThe pension item is correct and we will agree to it. The brokerage item is mostly wrong: the shares were inherited from Gwen's mother in 2021 and the stepped-up basis was $51,220, so the real gain is $7,680, long-term. We estimate the corrected balance at roughly $1,900 before interest and will ask for the penalty to be waived, since the omission happened during the months Hiroshi was in hospice care.\nContact with the IRS\nI called the number on the notice on 1/5/26 and spoke with Mr. Hadley (ID 1004471892). He granted a 30-day extension; our response is now due February 6, 2026. The response goes by fax to 855-555-0118. My CAF number is 0312-44871-R.\nAuthority to act\nMrs. Ito has been living at Cedar Glen Memory Care in Astoria since October and was diagnosed with Alzheimer's disease last year. Her daughter, Naomi Ito-Reyes, holds a durable power of attorney and signed Form 2848 on her behalf. All calls and mail go to Naomi: 503-555-0156, naomi.itoreyes@inboxmail.example, 1915 SE Clinton St, Portland, Oregon 97202. Do not phone Cedar Glen.\nNext steps\nPrepare Form 8949 with the inherited basis; attach the estate's date-of-death valuation.\nDraft the response and penalty waiver request for Naomi's signature by January 23.\nIf a balance remains, Naomi wants it debited from the estate checking account ending 5590.", "kind": "Word document", "detail": "376 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Gwendolyn P. Farnsworth-Ito", "Renee Calloway", "Mrs. Farnsworth-Ito", "Hiroshi Ito", "Mr. Hadley", "Naomi Ito-Reyes"], "companies": ["Calloway Tax & Advisory", "AUR", "IRS", "Pinnacle Ridge Brokerage", "Pacific Cannery Workers Pension Trust"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 1.1000000014901161, "modelMs": 20297.400000002235, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 3, "text": "IRS", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "IRS"}, {"start": 27, "end": 50, "text": "Calloway Tax & Advisory", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Calloway Tax & Advisory"}, {"start": 89, "end": 116, "text": "Gwendolyn P. Farnsworth-Ito", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Gwendolyn P. Farnsworth-Ito"}, {"start": 128, "end": 137, "text": "2019-0338", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "2019-0338"}, {"start": 142, "end": 153, "text": "XXX-XX-3244", "kind": "ssn", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "XXX-XX-3244"}, {"start": 161, "end": 167, "text": "CP2000", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "CP2000"}, {"start": 195, "end": 211, "text": "December 8, 2025", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "December 8, 2025"}, {"start": 212, "end": 215, "text": "AUR", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "AUR